  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced.\n• Thinly slice brown onion.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Roughly chop coriander.\n• Pick and thinly slice mint leaves.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Cut mini flourtortillas into wedges.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Drain and rinse lentils.\n• Drain sweetcorn.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67595ab3c9ec1c71c3879fe0-6eda6f25.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine coriander, tomato, corn and a drizzle of the white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67595ab3c9ec1c71c3879fe0-6f87caf9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small bowl, combine mint, Greek-style yoghurt and a small drizzle of olive oil. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67595ab3c9ec1c71c3879fe0-d8715473.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread tortilla wedges in a single layer on a lined oven tray. Drizzle (or spray) with olive oil. Season to taste, then toss to coat.\n• Bake until golden, 8-10 minutes. TIP: If the tortilla wedges don't fit in a single layer, divide them between two oven trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67595ab3c9ec1c71c3879fe0-e7db5ca6.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook carrot and onion, stirring, until softened, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add lentils and cook, until heated through, 2 minutes.\n• Add garlic and tandoori paste and cook, stirring until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Stir in tomato paste and coconut milk and simmer until thickened, 2-3 minutes. Season to taste. TIP: Add a splash of water to loosen the mixture, if needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67595ab3c9ec1c71c3879fe0-2a877977.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Indian-style coconut lentil dhal between bowls.\n• Top lentils with salsa and a dollop of mint yoghurt.\n• Serve with tortilla chips. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67595ab3c9ec1c71c3879fe0-d2da8e19.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
